<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="scroll-smooth" lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-background text-on-surface font-body-md">
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <main>
      <section class="border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface py-8 sm:py-12 lg:py-20">
        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-container-max grid-cols-1 items-center gap-9 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] lg:gap-14">
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <p class="mb-4 text-label-md font-label-md font-semibold text-primary">A clearer rental profile</p>
            <h1 class="mb-5 text-headline-xl font-headline-xl text-primary">Carry your rental story forward</h1>
            <p class="max-w-xl text-body-lg font-body-lg leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
              Keep profile details, application documents, messages, and payment
              records organized so you can approach each rental with useful context
              already in one place.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
              <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-7 py-3 text-center font-bold text-on-primary transition hover:opacity-90" href="/signup">Create renter account</a>
              <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-primary px-7 py-3 text-center font-bold text-primary transition hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/faqs?q=HomiScore">How HomiScore works</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <figure class="min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-lg">
            <img
              alt="Renter reviewing housing documents and a phone in a bright apartment"
              class="aspect-[16/9] max-h-[300px] w-full object-cover lg:max-h-none lg:aspect-[4/3]"
              decoding="async"
              fetchpriority="high"
              height="1086"
              src="/images/renters/renter-workflow.jpg"
              width="1448"
            />
            <figcaption class="border-t border-outline-variant px-4 py-3 text-body-sm text-secondary">
              Keep the information for your next rental decision together.
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="renter-profile-heading" class="bg-surface-container-lowest py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-container-max px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-9 max-w-2xl text-center">
            <h2 id="renter-profile-heading" class="mb-4 text-headline-lg font-headline-lg text-primary">Build a reusable renter profile</h2>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              HomiScore is supporting profile context. It does not guarantee approval
              and should be considered alongside the information relevant to each application.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
            <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="hf-icon-tile material-symbols-outlined mb-5 inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-white">badge</span>
              <h3 class="mb-3 text-headline-md font-headline-md text-primary">One profile</h3>
              <p class="text-body-md leading-relaxed text-secondary">Keep core account, identity, and rental details in a consistent workspace instead of rebuilding the same context for every task.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="hf-icon-tile material-symbols-outlined mb-5 inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-secondary-container text-primary">fact_check</span>
              <h3 class="mb-3 text-headline-md font-headline-md text-primary">Clear progress</h3>
              <p class="text-body-md leading-relaxed text-secondary">See which profile and verification steps are complete and which items still need attention before an application.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="hf-icon-tile material-symbols-outlined mb-5 inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high text-primary">folder_shared</span>
              <h3 class="mb-3 text-headline-md font-headline-md text-primary">Relevant records</h3>
              <p class="text-body-md leading-relaxed text-secondary">Organize documents, application activity, messages, and available payment history around the rental relationship.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="application-heading" class="py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-container-max grid-cols-1 gap-10 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)] lg:items-start lg:gap-16">
          <div class="max-w-xl">
            <p class="mb-3 text-label-md font-semibold text-primary">Application readiness</p>
            <h2 id="application-heading" class="mb-5 text-headline-lg font-headline-lg text-primary">Prepare once, review before you submit</h2>
            <p class="text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
              Complete the profile and verification steps available to your account,
              then review the documents and details requested for a specific property.
            </p>
            <a class="mt-7 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-primary px-6 py-3 font-bold text-primary transition hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/signup">Start with an account</a>
          </div>

          <ol class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <% [
              ['1', 'Create your account', 'Sign up and choose the renter role for the correct workspace.'],
              ['2', 'Complete profile steps', 'Add the requested account and verification information.'],
              ['3', 'Review each application', 'Check the property request and confirm the information you intend to submit.'],
              ['4', 'Track the next steps', 'Keep status, messages, and related documents together after submission.']
            ].forEach(([number, heading, copy]) => { %>
              <li class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5">
                <span class="mb-4 inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white" aria-hidden="true"><%= number %></span>
                <h3 class="mb-2 text-body-lg font-semibold text-primary"><%= heading %></h3>
                <p class="text-body-md leading-relaxed text-secondary"><%= copy %></p>
              </li>
            <% }) %>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="payment-records-heading" class="bg-primary py-12 text-white sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-container-max px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-16">
            <div>
              <h2 id="payment-records-heading" class="mb-4 text-headline-lg font-headline-lg">Keep payment records understandable</h2>
              <p class="text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-white/85">
                Where payment workflows are enabled for an account, HomiFund can
                organize scheduled amounts, due dates, status, and related records.
                Processing and availability depend on the connected service and setup.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
              <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/25 p-5">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined mb-3">calendar_month</span>
                <h3 class="mb-2 font-semibold">Schedule context</h3>
                <p class="text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80">See the dates and amounts shown for the account.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/25 p-5">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined mb-3">receipt_long</span>
                <h3 class="mb-2 font-semibold">Status history</h3>
                <p class="text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80">Review available payment status and past records.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/25 p-5">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined mb-3">forum</span>
                <h3 class="mb-2 font-semibold">Related context</h3>
                <p class="text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80">Keep messages and supporting documents close to the record.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="renter-faq-heading" class="bg-surface py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
          <h2 id="renter-faq-heading" class="mb-8 text-center text-headline-lg font-headline-lg text-primary">Renter questions</h2>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <details class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-white" data-disclosure>
              <summary class="faq-summary flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-4 sm:px-6">
                <span class="font-semibold text-primary">Does HomiScore guarantee rental approval?</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-chevron material-symbols-outlined shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform">expand_more</span>
              </summary>
              <p class="border-t border-outline-variant px-4 py-5 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-secondary sm:px-6">No. HomiScore is supporting profile context. The landlord or property manager remains responsible for the application decision.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-white" data-disclosure>
              <summary class="faq-summary flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-4 sm:px-6">
                <span class="font-semibold text-primary">Does HomiFund change my credit score?</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-chevron material-symbols-outlined shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform">expand_more</span>
              </summary>
              <p class="border-t border-outline-variant px-4 py-5 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-secondary sm:px-6">HomiScore is separate from a consumer credit score. This page does not promise credit-bureau reporting, so confirm any credit-related service with support before relying on it.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-white" data-disclosure>
              <summary class="faq-summary flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-4 sm:px-6">
                <span class="font-semibold text-primary">How should I handle sensitive documents?</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-chevron material-symbols-outlined shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform">expand_more</span>
              </summary>
              <p class="border-t border-outline-variant px-4 py-5 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-secondary sm:px-6">Use the relevant document or verification workflow instead of a general message. Review what is requested before submitting it and contact support if the correct workflow is unclear.</p>
            </details>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-7 text-center">
            <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-md px-4 font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4" href="/faqs?category=renters">View all renter FAQs</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="border-y border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest py-14 sm:py-16">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-margin-mobile text-center md:px-margin-desktop">
          <h2 class="mb-4 text-headline-lg font-headline-lg text-primary">Build your renter workspace</h2>
          <p class="mx-auto mb-7 max-w-2xl text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">Create an account to start your profile, or contact support when you need help choosing the right next step.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-7 py-3 font-bold text-white" href="/signup">Create renter account</a>
            <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-primary px-7 py-3 font-bold text-primary" href="/contact#contact-form">Contact renter support</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
